# Scratch-file patterns are ANCHORED with a leading slash. A pattern with no
# slash matches at ANY depth: a bare junit.xml in a product .gitignore silently
# excluded a required committed fixture in P060 of this mission, and a cold
# clone then failed with 17 failures and 9 errors while every local check
# passed. validation/validate_tree_hygiene.py checks both directions.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
/build/
/dist/
/.venv/
/venv/
/.pytest_cache/
/.hypothesis/
/.ruff_cache/
/.coverage
/htmlcov/
/junit.xml
/.config/
# This product serialises no model of any kind: nothing here writes a joblib or
# pickle artifact. These patterns exist so a future change cannot add one
# silently and ship it.
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.joblib
*.pkl
# The committed corpus, its manifest, the generator and the transcript of the
# run that produced them are all evidence and must reach a cold clone. They are
# listed as negations so a future broad pattern cannot swallow them silently.
!/data/corpus_layered.json
!/data/corpus_cyclic.json
!/data/corpus_manifest.json
!/data/generate_corpus.py
!/data/generate_corpus_output.txt
# Every validation script's raw output is evidence and must ship.
!/validation/*_output.txt
